WEBVTT

00:14:00.856 --> 00:14:03.201
jer se vraćate kući

00:14:03.201 --> 00:14:06.131
nazad na Zemlju.
(Smijeh)

00:14:06.131 --> 00:14:08.555
Prije 20 godina morali smo učiti
Ruski jezik,

00:14:08.555 --> 00:14:11.171
i onda kada smo naučili Ruski,

00:14:13.751 --> 00:14:16.265
onda smo spoznali orbitalnu mehaniku
leta na Ruskom.

00:14:16.265 --> 00:14:19.235
I kako upravljati letjelicom,

00:14:19.235 --> 00:14:20.704
onda smo išli u simulator

00:14:20.704 --> 00:14:23.276
i vježbali stalno, iz nova na novo.

00:14:23.276 --> 00:14:24.986
I dok letite ovim meteorom

00:14:24.986 --> 00:14:27.775
i dok ga upravljate da sletite u radijus
od 15 kilometara

00:14:27.775 --> 00:14:28.919
bilo gdje na Zemlji.

00:14:28.919 --> 00:14:31.844
I dok smo se vraćali dole